    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38736" root="معز" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعِزَ الشَّىْءُ</span></b> , [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعِزَتِ الأَرْضُ</span>, accord. to
the explanation of the inf. n. in the S,] aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَزَ</span></b> ,
(TK,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَزٌ</span>, (S, K, TK,) <i>The thing</i> [and
<i>the ground</i>] <i>was,</i> or <i>became, hard.</i> (S, * K, * TK.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعِزَ</span> said of a man: see 4. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَزْتُ المِعْزَى</span>,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَضَأَنْتُ الضَّأْنَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَزَ</span></b> , <i>I set apart the goats from
the sheep.</i> (K.)

